      "shortDescription": "GF, legally Georg Fischer Ltd, develops flow solutions for buildings, industrial processes and infrastructure. Its current portfolio covers plastic and metal piping systems, fittings, valves, flow automation, joining technologies, water distribution, and radiant heating and cooling systems.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "Georg Fischer Ltd is a Swiss industrial group founded in Schaffhausen in 1802. Following the divestment of GF Machining Solutions in 2025 and GF Casting Solutions in 2026, the company operates as a flow-solutions business through GF Industry and Infrastructure Flow Solutions and GF Building Flow Solutions.",
        "Official corporate sources document pipes, fittings, valves, automation and jointing technologies for transporting water, chemicals and gases, together with building systems for safe drinking-water distribution and energy-efficient radiant heating and cooling. GF serves building, industrial and infrastructure applications including municipal water networks, data centres, microelectronics, food and beverage production, energy and other process industries."
